            <h1 class="mb-6 max-w-4xl font-headline text-4xl text-on-background md:text-display-lg">Why AI guardrails are not enough: the case for continuous agent monitoring</h1>
            <p class="mb-8 max-w-3xl font-body text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">
                Pre-deployment safeguards establish how an AI agent should behave. Continuous assurance helps an organization verify that permissions, human intervention, and accountable behavior remain effective once real work begins.
            </p>
